codecpack: the Phorepoc codec pack
Copyright The Phorepoc Authors (see AUTHORS)

Phorepoc was founded by Kyriakos Bompotis.

This repository holds the recipes and the Symbian-side glue that build FFmpeg and OpenH264 for Phorepoc. The codec
sources are not copied here: the recipes fetch the pinned releases at build time and check their SHA-256.
